{"3618520":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Twin Shot Deluxe","steam_appid":3618520,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4467910],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/c5c93592da82e253ca9076769dd55920.poster.avif?t=1790949477\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/c5c93592da82e253ca9076769dd55920.webm?t=1790949477\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/c5c93592da82e253ca9076769dd55920.mp4?t=1790949477\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Angel Cats are back and better than ever before in this <strong>complete remaster<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin Shot Deluxe is an arcade platform shooter where players defend their homeland from invaders using bows and arrows. Take aim at over <strong>200+ brand new levels<\/strong> set across four worlds, each with unique challenges, bosses and enemies. Play solo or team up with friends in <strong>local co-op (1-4 players)<\/strong> or play competitively to see who will be crowned champion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new Atlantis theme to explore, defeat additional bosses, unlock fancy headwear with special powers for extended replay, and much more... <strong>relive your childhood and take to the skies!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/2fcad2983c9d67df7f92cd825ee4db25.poster.avif?t=1790949477\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/2fcad2983c9d67df7f92cd825ee4db25.webm?t=1790949477\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin Shot Deluxe has received a <strong>complete graphical overhaul.<\/strong> We have painstakingly redone every single sprite, animation, character, background and menu to elevate the art to new heights.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We could not leave the game lagging in the past at 20FPS, it has now been upgraded to an angelic <strong>60FPS<\/strong>, and now with a modern <strong>16:9<\/strong> ratio, that's <strong>78%<\/strong> more Twin Shot. We even have a brand new intro animatic and ending illustrations remastered to pixel art perfection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/604ee157eaaa4821f1a5b868e83b99c1.poster.avif?t=1790949477\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/604ee157eaaa4821f1a5b868e83b99c1.webm?t=1790949477\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/604ee157eaaa4821f1a5b868e83b99c1.mp4?t=1790949477\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just the characters and enemies that have had a revamp... meet Colossus, he's big, mean and totally climbable. Unlock the <strong>new Atlantis theme<\/strong> with exciting new enemies and mechanics to enjoy across its 50 stages.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join friends and family in multiplayer (<strong>expanded to up to 4 players<\/strong>) with gamepad and keyboard support.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your archery skills to the ultimate test and explore <strong>200+ new levels<\/strong> built from the ground up.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved air control <strong>(✓)<\/strong>, stop on a dime <strong>(✓)<\/strong>, coyote time <strong>(✓)<\/strong>, variable jump <strong>(✓)<\/strong>... Deluxe has totally revamped controls that still feel just like you remember!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/ef309bf8ab0b573c7503861c462b2ecd.poster.avif?t=1790949477\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/ef309bf8ab0b573c7503861c462b2ecd.webm?t=1790949477\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/ef309bf8ab0b573c7503861c462b2ecd.mp4?t=1790949477\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheats and Treats are BACK! Unlock a plethora of abilities and options for <strong>enhanced replay.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your loot on familiar character skins, fun modes like Tag and Fart mode, weapons and health options, listen to music tracks, make your character a GIANT and more!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to hum along to the iconic earworm tracks with music uncompressed and crystal clear. With an added bonus of some brand <strong>new music by the game's original composer Dave Cowen.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/078eb92480b3a6677c9353b52d94568f.poster.avif?t=1790949477\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/078eb92480b3a6677c9353b52d94568f.webm?t=1790949477\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/078eb92480b3a6677c9353b52d94568f.mp4?t=1790949477\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing <strong>HATS!<\/strong> Battle amongst your friends or alone to see who will be crowned champion. Hats aren't just hilariously cosmetic but also come with additional buffs. Ditch the crown for new headwear and new powers... the twisted hat lets you shoot backwards, jump off enemies' heads with the old boot or turn yourself to stone with the Medusa Headdress.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Tag mode, dial up the competitiveness to 11. Tag other players with an arrow and claim the prized hat for yourself... a real game of <strong>Angel Cat and Mouse!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/cc5f0e41cf9ab8e45b64a9310d7fcb25.poster.avif?t=1790949477\" width=616 height=368 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/cc5f0e41cf9ab8e45b64a9310d7fcb25.webm?t=1790949477\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The good ol' days of carefree gaming are back. <strong>Twin Shot Deluxe<\/strong> is our first release in the <strong>Nitrome Classics<\/strong> series.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are bringing back beloved games of old re-equipped for modern gamers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look out for more Nitrome Classics games in the near future. Re-live your childhood and complete your collection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer Note:<\/strong> Whether you originally played the classic <i>Twin Shot 1<\/i> or <i>2<\/i> back in the day on <strong>Miniclip<\/strong>, <strong>Armor Games<\/strong>, the official <strong>Nitrome website<\/strong>, or regional portals like <strong>4399<\/strong> (frequently known as <strong>双头射手<\/strong>), this ultimate deluxe edition was built entirely for you! Grab a friend and dive back into that perfect slice of childhood arcade nostalgia.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/400bb70621e42220866f879da1e247a0.apng?t=1790949477\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/400bb70621e42220866f879da1e247a0.poster.avif?t=1790949477\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=212 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/c5c93592da82e253ca9076769dd55920.poster.avif?t=1790949477\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/c5c93592da82e253ca9076769dd55920.webm?t=1790949477\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3618520\/extras\/c5c93592da82e253ca9076769dd55920.mp4?t=1790949477\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Angel Cats are back and better than ever before in this <strong>complete remaster<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin Shot Deluxe is an arcade platform shooter